// REJECTS: Field 'query' is required
//
// Inside `execution: Single` all three of query, mapping and runtime are required, and the
// keyword is `query` even though the grammar rule and the protocol field are both called
// `func`. The diagnostic uses the grammar spelling.
//
// Nested required fields are easy to lose: the outer element's required-field check is the
// visible one, and this one lives two levels down in visitExecution.
###Service
Service fixture::neg::NoQuery
{
   pattern: '/fixture/neg/noquery';
   documentation: 'a single execution with no query';
   execution: Single
   {
      mapping: fixture::neg::Mapping;
      runtime: fixture::neg::Runtime;
   }
}
